          %h2#references References
          %p
            2-geometric quantization over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifolds"} smooth manifolds
            is discussed in section 6 and section 7 of
          %ul
            %li#RogersPhD
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Rogers"}> Chris Rogers
              ,
              %em Higher symplectic geometry
              PhD thesis (2011) (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1106.4068"}> arXiv:1106.4068
              )
          %p with further indications in
          %ul
            %li#Rogers
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Rogers"}> Chris Rogers
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higher geometric quantization
              %em Higher Structures 2011
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/RogersGottingen11.pdf", :title => "pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            The special case of geometric quantization over infinitesimal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action+groupoids"} action groupoids
            can be described in terms of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BRST+complexes"} BRST complexes
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/geometric+quantization#ReferencesBRST"} Geometric quantization – References – Geometric BRST quantization
          %p
            Higher geometric quantization in a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} cohesive (∞,1)-topos
            over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} smooth ∞-groupoids
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Rogers"} Chris Rogers
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/infinity-geometric+prequantization"} infinity-geometric prequantization
          %p and the examples of higher Chern-Simons theories in
          %ul
            %li#FiorenzaSchreiber
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Rogers"} Chris Rogers
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Higher+geometric+prequantum+theory"} Higher geometric prequantum theory
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luigi+Alfonsi"}> Luigi Alfonsi
              , §3 in:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higher geometry in physics
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Encyclopedia+of+Mathematical+Physics+2nd+ed"} Encyclopedia of Mathematical Physics 2nd ed
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07308"} arXiv:2312.07308
